{%- comment -%}
  ELSORA wave background (cart page). Reused one-to-one from
  sections/difference-grid.liquid (the "Cold is the most underused tool in
  skincare." section on the PDRN sandbox page): same white -> blue -> white
  gradient, same top fade, same masked wave-ribbon SVG paths. Only the
  background layer is reused; no cards or other elements from that section.
  Rendered as an absolutely positioned layer (z-index: -1) behind the page
  content: the container it should cover must be position: relative with
  isolation: isolate (main-cart-items.liquid sets this on #MainContent).
{%- endcomment -%}
